    "quality_selection": "Both RF/GP use the same 24 training-ranked RGB and perception descriptors. Five distance relations remain a paired ablation. The initial 29-column candidate added five near-minus-far output differences. In already-open historical development diagnostics it raised RF MAE .07893 to .08199 and GP .08231 to .08664 on geography40, and slightly raised both motion errors. Therefore choose the common 24-column subset before inspecting new-site RGB or GT. Keep both 24/29 frozen candidates, matched-budget baselines, and all initial results. These historical diagnostics now form part of development confirmation and cannot serve as untouched final tests.",
